# The Debug build of protobuf for Windows (libprotobufd.lib) is ~102MB, over
# GitHub's 100MB push limit. Keep ONLY that oversized Debug variant out of git --
# the Release variant (libprotobuf.lib, ~19MB) and the other vendored prebuilt libs
# (ffmpeg/boost/opencv/python36/...) stay tracked. NOTE: the 102MB blob is also in
# OLD history; untracking it here stops it being re-added but does NOT retro-purge
# it -- pushing it to GitHub still needs an explicit history rewrite (or git-lfs).
pyapps/GameAISDK/Modules/protobuf/Windows/x64/Debug/
